§ `ss 2, 4, 5 -- must I register`

#ASSERT NOT `Am I carrying on business in Singapore` `a salaried employee`
#ASSERT NOT `Am I carrying on business in Singapore` `a charity stall not for gain`
#ASSERT `Am I carrying on business in Singapore` `an online seller with no place of business who trades in Singapore`
#ASSERT NOT `Am I carrying on business in Singapore` `a trader abroad with nothing in Singapore`

#ASSERT `Must I register` `a cafe under a trade name`
#ASSERT NOT `Must I register` `a sole trader under her own full name`
#ASSERT NOT `Must I register` `a firm of individuals under all their full names`
#ASSERT `Must I register` `a firm with a corporate partner under all the full names`
#ASSERT NOT `Must I register` `a sole advocate in practice`
#ASSERT `Must I register` `a sole practitioner whose profession regulations take out`
#ASSERT NOT `Must I register` `a salaried employee`
#ASSERT NOT `Must I register` `a principal whose nominee filed the section 7 particulars`
#ASSERT NOT `Must I register` `an old First Schedule hawker`

#ASSERT `May I choose to register although I need not` `a sole trader under her own full name`

§ `s 6(3) -- who may lodge`

#ASSERT NOT `May this person lodge my application` `as an individual proprietor` `another partner of my firm`
#ASSERT `May this person lodge my application` `as an individual proprietor` `a registered corporate service provider authorised by and acting for me`

§ `s 17 -- identical names`

#ASSERT `Can I take a name identical to an earlier one` `a live registered business name or corporation or limited partnership` 600 FALSE EQUALS `barred to me`
#ASSERT `Can I take a name identical to an earlier one` `a live registered business name or corporation or limited partnership` 0 TRUE EQUALS `open to me as far as this rule goes`
#ASSERT `Can I take a name identical to an earlier one` `a business name cancelled or ceased under this Act` 11 FALSE EQUALS `barred to me`
#ASSERT `Can I take a name identical to an earlier one` `a business name cancelled or ceased under this Act` 12 FALSE EQUALS `open to me as far as this rule goes`
#ASSERT `Can I take a name identical to an earlier one` `a company dissolved after being struck off` 30 FALSE EQUALS `barred to me`
#ASSERT `Can I take a name identical to an earlier one` `a registered foreign company that ceased business in Singapore` 3 FALSE EQUALS `open to me only if the Registrar chooses to register it`

§ `ss 9, 17(1), 10 -- refusal`

