#ASSERT `Must my application be refused` `nothing against me` `barred to me`
#ASSERT `Must my application be refused` `the Registrar thinks the name undesirable` `open to me as far as this rule goes`
#ASSERT NOT `Must my application be refused` `an undesirable name the Minister consents to` `open to me as far as this rule goes`
#ASSERT `Must my application be refused` `an unlawful purpose the Minister consents to` `open to me as far as this rule goes`

#ASSERT NOT `Does registration make the name my property`

